{"id":"661423","name":"烧椒酱","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/661423/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"青椒","amount":"200g"},{"name":"大蒜","amount":"2头"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"2匙"},{"name":"酱油","amount":"3勺"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"青椒和剥好的蒜米清洗干净后晾干水分，这种青椒口感微辣，做烧椒酱最适合不过了。","img":"images/661423/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"大蒜打成碎粒。","img":"images/661423/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"青椒剪去根部。","img":"images/661423/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"青椒倒入锅里干炒。","img":"images/661423/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"用锅铲按压翻炒。","img":"images/661423/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"炒成表面起酥皮即可。","img":"images/661423/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放凉。","img":"images/661423/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再打后碎粒。","img":"images/661423/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"青椒和蒜放入大碗里。","img":"images/661423/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入盐。","img":"images/661423/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"锅里热油。","img":"images/661423/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"烧至滚烫后浇入碗内，激发出香气。","img":"images/661423/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"用筷子搅拌均匀。","img":"images/661423/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"再加入酱油、蚝油、鸡精调味即可。","img":"images/661423/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661423/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放凉后装入瓶罐保存。","img":"images/661423/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。下饭神器。","img":"images/661423/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}